  "question": {
    "text": "Consider two chemical reactions (A) and (B) that<br />take place during metallurgical process:<br />(A) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCO</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover><msub><mi>ZnO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub></math><br />(B) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>ZnS</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>ZnO</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub></math><br />The correct option of names given to them respectively is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "MNYoH",
      "text": "(A) is calcination and (B) is roasting",
